val, a portrait of the baron by Henri-Pierre Danloux (1791). The green Chinese celadon vases mounted in gilt bronze, which are visible on the mantelpiece, were sold together with their identical pendants in three lots by Christie's on 8 July 2021 in The Exceptional Sale for a total of GB£1,620,000.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABesenval%2C_baron_de2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yue_ware_with_motif_3rd_century_Western_Jin_Zhejiang.jpg/250px-Yue_ware_with_motif_3rd_century_Western_Jin_Zhejiang.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yue_ware_with_motif_3rd_century_Western_Jin_Zhejiang.jpg/500px-Yue_ware_with_motif_3rd_century_Western_Jin_Zhejiang.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yue_ware_with_motif_3rd_century_Western_Jin_Zhejiang.jpg/250px-Yue_ware_with_motif_3rd_century_Western_Jin_Zhejiang.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYue_ware_with_motif_3rd_century_Western_Jin_Zhejiang.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Pot_tripode_Mus%C3%A9e_Guimet_2418.jpg/250px-Pot_tripode_Mus%C3%A9e_Guimet_2418.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Pot_tripode_Mus%C3%A9e_Guimet_2418.jpg/500px-Pot_tripode_Mus%C3%A9e_Guimet_2418.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Pot_tripode_Mus%C3%A9e_Guimet_2418.jpg/250px-Pot_tripode_Mus%C3%A9e_Guimet_2418.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APot_tripode_Mus%C3%A9e_Guimet_2